---
import Section from "../site/Section.astro"
import Split from "../site/Split.astro"
import Stage from "../site/Stage.astro"
import MessageToBlock from "../product/MessageToBlock.astro"
---

<Section>
  <Split>
    <div slot="start" class="copy">
      <h2 class="h2">The discussion is the scratch space.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        The page has one discussion, beside the blocks. A message stays in it until someone chooses Add to page, which puts the
        message's text on the page as a text block; someone who can only comment chooses Suggest for page.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        Mention <span class="mono">@observe</span>, one of your connected agents or a service account that takes runs, and it starts
        an investigation that writes its answer into the page as blocks. The server posts one status line in the discussion when the
        run ends. Mentioning an agent needs the Editor role.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div slot="end" data-in-view="rise">
      <Stage><MessageToBlock /></Stage>
    </div>
  </Split>
</Section>

<style>
  .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .copy .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
</style>
